================================================================
3. NOTICES
================================================================

SYNTHETIC DATA. Every row in data/ was generated by src/gmb_generate.py. No
figure describes a real business, a real customer or a real transaction. The
account names, product names and financial results are invented. Nothing in
this repository is a client result, market evidence or a verified commercial
outcome, and it must not be presented as one.

STANDARD COSTS. The dataset uses standard costs revised annually, not actual
purchase costs. The cost effect reported by the dashboard reflects a change in
costing assumptions and is not evidence of supplier price movement.

THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL NOT INCLUDED. Microsoft Power BI is required to open the
.pbix file and is not distributed here. Segoe UI is named as a font family in
the theme file; no font binary is included or redistributed. No third-party
icon set, image, dataset or component is included in this repository.
